  summary: >-
    One of the most challenging videos we've ever made. How do you tell an uplifting story about a new baby when you know that baby is going to pass away? This is the story of a little girl born with a fatal birth defect, and a family that chose to love her fully for every hour they had together. The family and their friends gave us extraordinary access, and AdventHealth, then Florida Hospital for Children, trusted us to make something unconventional: a piece that still shows the full scope of care they deliver to every patient and the people who love them. It won Best in Film and was runner-up for Best in Show at the 2016 Orlando ADDYs.
